<title>USA: Minntech names McGoldrick president, CEO.</title>
<headline>Minntech names McGoldrick president, CEO.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Minntech Corp said Tuesday its board of directors appointed Thomas McGoldrick as president and chief executive officer.</p>
<p>McGoldrick was named acting president and chief executive on January 31, the company said. He has been with Minntech since 1985 as vice president, corporate development, and was promoted to executive vice president in 1995.  </p>
<p>McGoldrick replaced Louis Cosentino, who resigned, the company said.</p>
<p>Shares of Minntech, which manufactures medical devices, were unchanged at 10-1/4.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
